{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3690980/extras/Screenboy_screen_shot.png?t=1753420216\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Screen Boy\u2019s girlfriend has been kidnapped by the sinister Lord Static!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">To make matters worse, Screen Boy has been thrown deep into a dark, treacherous well\u2014trapped in a labyrinth of underground caves crawling with danger.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Now, he must fight his way to the surface, dodge deadly traps, outsmart Lord Static\u2019s loyal henchmen, and rescue Screen Girl before it\u2019s too late.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Will he rise from the shadows and save the day, or will the Evil Lord static silence him forever?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A 2D Adventure Platformer designed to take you back to the 90's with Big Bosses, traps , pests and so much more. play with keyboard or joypad your game, your choice.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3690980?t=1753420216","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3690980/ab62983833908ee2f494289c31f900efa3db2082/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1753420216","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3690980/2e6e70431557200bc842aabf9008f06bcba03cdd/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1753420216","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3690980/2e6e70431557200bc842aabf9008f06bcba03cdd/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1753420216","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" s